msgid "No free space. Start DUHACH! in Windows to make room for MAN."
msgstr "没有可用空间。请在 Windows 中启动 DUHACH! 为 MAN 腾出空间。"

#: installer.rs:92
msgid "MAN is running from this disk"
msgstr "MAN 正在从此磁盘运行"

#: installer.rs:96
msgid "In use: a partition is mounted"
msgstr "使用中：有分区已挂载"

#: installer.rs:98
msgid "Too small, MAN needs {need}"
msgstr "太小，MAN 需要 {need}"

#: installer.rs:108
msgid "Install MAN"
msgstr "安装 MAN"

#: installer.rs:126
msgid "MAN is being installed. Please wait until it finishes."
msgstr "正在安装 MAN。请等待完成。"

#: installer.rs:143
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: installer.rs:155
msgid "_Restart in This Language"
msgstr "以此语言重新启动(_R)"

#: installer.rs:167
msgid "The live session restarts in the chosen language, and MAN is installed in it."
msgstr "Live 会话将以所选语言重新启动，MAN 也会以该语言安装。"

#: installer.rs:213
msgid "Welcome to MAN"
msgstr "欢迎使用 MAN"

#: installer.rs:214
msgid ""
"A fast, open and fully customizable GNOME system.\n"
"Install it on this computer, or keep exploring the live session."
msgstr ""
"快速、开放、可完全自定义的 GNOME 系统。\n"
"将它安装到这台电脑上，或继续体验 Live 会话。"

#: installer.rs:218
msgid "_Install MAN…"
msgstr "安装 MAN(_I)…"

#: installer.rs:220
msgid "_Keep Trying MAN"
msgstr "继续试用 MAN(_K)"

#: installer.rs:223
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "正在查找磁盘…"

#: installer.rs:250
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

#: installer.rs:265
msgid "This computer was started in legacy BIOS mode. MAN can only be installed on UEFI computers: restart and choose the UEFI boot option."
msgstr "这台电脑以传统 BIOS 模式启动。MAN 只能安装在 UEFI 电脑上：请重新启动并选择 UEFI 启动选项。"

#: installer.rs:283
msgid "The system helper returned no disk information."
msgstr "系统助手没有返回磁盘信息。"

#: installer.rs:348
msgid "  ·  EFI"
msgstr "  ·  EFI"

#: installer.rs:356
msgid "_Next"
msgstr "下一步(_N)"

#: installer.rs:364
msgid "Erase Disk and Install MAN"
msgstr "清除磁盘并安装 MAN"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Everything on the chosen disk is deleted, Windows included."
msgstr "所选磁盘上的所有内容都会被删除，包括 Windows。"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Recommended. Everything on the chosen disk is deleted."
msgstr "推荐。所选磁盘上的所有内容都会被删除。"

#: installer.rs:369
msgid "Install Alongside Windows"
msgstr "与 Windows 并存安装"

#: installer.rs:370
msgid "Recommended. MAN uses the free space next to Windows; Windows and its files stay. Choose the system at every start."
msgstr "推荐。MAN 使用 Windows 旁边的可用空间；Windows 及其文件保持不变。每次启动时选择系统。"

#: installer.rs:377
msgid "Reinstall MAN"
msgstr "重新安装 MAN"

#: installer.rs:378
msgid "Replaces the system but keeps personal files in /home. The current system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "替换系统，但保留 /home 中的个人文件。当前系统会保存为快照。"

