#: installer.rs:980
msgid "{free} of free space (a boot partition and the system partition are created)"
msgstr "{free} 可用空间（将创建启动分区和系统分区）"

#: installer.rs:981
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: installer.rs:981
